WEBVTT

00:00.900 --> 00:04.100
Allow me to congratulate you 
on your upcoming nuptials.

00:04.310 --> 00:07.610
I am Kaine Tully, from 
the Aria Trading Company.

00:08.400 --> 00:11.170
I'm Rishe Irmgard Weitzner.

00:11.170 --> 00:14.860
Thank you for coming such 
a long way to meet with me.

00:16.990 --> 00:19.920
This really is a lovely 
time of year, isn't it?

00:18.420 --> 00:19.920
<i>He's as impressive as I remember.</i>

00:19.920 --> 00:23.030
<i>Just meeting his eye makes me 
feel like he's seen through me.</i>

00:19.920 --> 00:23.710
Lady Rishe, did you say your wedding will 
be in the middle of the eighth month?

00:23.710 --> 00:27.000
<i>But since I know him well, I 
should have the upper hand.</i>

00:23.710 --> 00:27.000
That means you'll become a 
bride under the summer skies.

00:27.300 --> 00:32.010
To have such a beautiful lady as 
the future mother of the country...

00:27.300 --> 00:32.010
<i>In order to avoid the war, 
and to live a long life,</i>

00:32.010 --> 00:35.010
I must say I'm jealous of 
the people of Galkhein.

00:32.010 --> 00:35.010
<i>I will have you lend me your aid, chief!</i>

00:36.890 --> 00:41.940
I'm sure you've already heard, but 
I want everything used in my wedding

00:41.940 --> 00:44.460
to be procured by the Aria Trading Company.

00:44.460 --> 00:47.770
Well, well! You have no idea how 
much I appreciate such a statement.

00:47.770 --> 00:51.340
Then, would it be possible 
to see your wares right now?

00:52.530 --> 00:53.780
Lady Rishe...

00:55.100 --> 00:59.030
I haven't a single item I would sell to you.

02:32.360 --> 02:35.580
Oh, pardon me. It seems you've misunderstood.

02:35.580 --> 02:37.960
However, it's just as I said.

02:37.960 --> 02:42.010
A lady such as yourself simply 
cannot become a customer of ours.

02:43.100 --> 02:44.260
May I ask why?

02:44.590 --> 02:49.770
The items which we are able to procure 
aren't in keeping with your level of resolve.

02:49.770 --> 02:51.150
Resolve?

02:52.110 --> 02:56.530
It seems that, for some reason, you're 
staking your life on this transaction.

02:57.780 --> 03:00.640
I've seen many different people in my time,

03:00.640 --> 03:05.030
but you seem to have a stronger 
resolve than any of them.

03:05.440 --> 03:10.820
This despite the fact that you're only 
buying wedding goods from a simple trader, you see?

03:11.360 --> 03:13.680
Well, it is a once-in-a-lifetime event.

03:13.680 --> 03:16.010
I've allowed myself to 
become overenthusiastic.

03:16.010 --> 03:18.460
I'm so inexperienced. 
It's quite embarrassing.

03:19.300 --> 03:24.300
Please, rest at ease. I'm certain your 
wedding ceremony will be splendid.

03:24.300 --> 03:29.660
However, unfortunately, our wares 
seem to be inadequate to the task.

03:30.240 --> 03:32.610
Thank you for your offer. It's been an honor.

03:32.610 --> 03:34.310
Ch-Chief Tully!

03:34.520 --> 03:38.570
All else aside, Galkhein is quite 
an impressive country, isn't it?

03:40.030 --> 03:45.470
We're thinking of forgetting our work for a 
while and spending a few days enjoying the sights.

03:46.410 --> 03:49.020
Please wait! If we could 
speak a little longer!

03:49.020 --> 03:53.500
Farewell, beautiful future crown princess.

04:09.160 --> 04:10.720
<i>Listen well, Rishe.</i>

04:11.220 --> 04:13.720
Become a merchant who can pick her customers.

04:14.260 --> 04:18.980
Offer wares or other value that 
they can only get through us.

04:18.980 --> 04:23.530
When you do that, then we're the 
ones who can choose our customers.

04:24.730 --> 04:27.320
<i>I couldn't make the chief choose me.</i>

04:27.840 --> 04:32.400
<i>But I'll need his connections when the Aria 
Trading Company spreads across the world.</i>

04:34.200 --> 04:35.900
Um, Lady Rishe?

04:36.980 --> 04:40.870
Why is the future crown 
princess working in a garden?

04:40.870 --> 04:46.090
Prince Arnold gave me this plot, so 
I thought I'd grow medicinal plants.

04:46.090 --> 04:49.600
Depending on how I mix them, I'll be 
able to make all sorts of medicines.

04:49.980 --> 04:52.100
I see...

04:53.380 --> 04:57.440
<i>Still, was he simply being wary of me?</i>

04:57.900 --> 05:03.180
<i>He is a cautious man, but he also 
loves an all-or-nothing gamble.</i>

05:04.670 --> 05:06.800
<i>Have I overlooked something?</i>

05:08.770 --> 05:14.080
We're thinking of forgetting our work for a 
while and spending a few days enjoying the sights.

05:15.470 --> 05:17.760
That's the end of my 
gardening this afternoon.

05:17.760 --> 05:19.250
A-Already?

05:19.250 --> 05:23.510
I'm going to rest in my room. I'll 
leave guarding the halls to you.

05:23.510 --> 05:24.760
Y-Yes, my lady!

05:28.090 --> 05:31.010
Still, are you sure about this, chief?

05:31.010 --> 05:33.890
You're kicking aside a way to make 
huge money from the crown princess.

05:33.890 --> 05:38.440
You dummy. If we took that lady on 
as a customer, we'd see heavy losses.

05:41.900 --> 05:44.510
Welcome back, Chief Tully.

05:43.280 --> 05:45.030
I can't drink any more.

05:45.030 --> 05:47.030
You win, miss.

05:47.840 --> 05:51.910
I did think you might deign 
to visit us soon, but this?

05:51.910 --> 05:55.730
Then, that was an invitation after all.

05:55.730 --> 05:56.980
I'm honored.

05:59.240 --> 06:01.290
I'm astounded.

06:01.290 --> 06:04.190
To think you'd outdrink 
my men while you waited.

06:04.190 --> 06:08.630
Since they're such enjoyable company, 
the drink just kept flowing.

06:08.630 --> 06:12.260
Setting that aside, that dye has 
taken quite beautifully to your hair.

06:12.720 --> 06:15.700
My hair color tends to 
stand out a bit, you see.

06:16.770 --> 06:21.870
If I told you I'd sell you the method, 
would you be open to negotiations with me?

06:22.660 --> 06:24.150
I would never!

06:24.150 --> 06:28.650
After all, you've brought something
 even more lucrative, haven't you?

06:30.160 --> 06:34.430
And now, just as you wished, 
we will begin our negotiations.

06:34.430 --> 06:36.090
Let's start with a drink.

06:36.090 --> 06:37.580
Just one thing first.

06:38.110 --> 06:41.790
While we're here, please speak freely.

06:42.190 --> 06:46.550
<i>When he speaks so formally to 
me, it sets me off-balance.</i>

06:46.550 --> 06:49.550
Well, if you insist.

06:55.980 --> 07:03.460
So, milady, no more of this "I want a 
dress for my wedding" charade, all right?

07:03.460 --> 07:08.000
Of course. It's obvious that trying 
such tricks on you won't work.

07:08.000 --> 07:09.360
Good.

07:09.800 --> 07:12.360
My intuition is telling me something.

07:12.620 --> 07:17.620
Lady Rishe, it says that I should take you 
on not as a client, but as a trading partner.

07:18.140 --> 07:21.030
I won't help with a plan 
if I don't know the full scope of it.

07:21.030 --> 07:25.310
But don't worry, despite appearances, 
I'm very dedicated to my work.

07:25.310 --> 07:31.130
I can promise you whatever profits, no, 
even greater profits than you've imagined.

07:31.130 --> 07:36.260
Now, how about you spill every last detail 
of this money-making scheme of yours!

07:37.190 --> 07:38.270
I can't tell you.

07:38.990 --> 07:39.800
What?

07:40.610 --> 07:43.630
I can't tell you about my plan.

07:43.630 --> 07:48.280
Even so, I want the Aria Trading 
Company to become my ally.

07:48.280 --> 07:51.580
You say the most interesting things, milady.

07:52.310 --> 07:55.210
You want me to enter into a contract 
without being told anything,

07:55.210 --> 07:57.010
and it isn't even certain 
that I'll profit from it.

07:57.010 --> 08:00.270
This is the type of offer 
that traders hate the most.

08:00.270 --> 08:02.470
I will, of course, prepare compensation.

08:02.470 --> 08:07.290
You're telling me to just trust you when 
you say I'll make a profit? A fine idea!

08:07.700 --> 08:09.540
<i>Within the next few years,</i>

08:09.540 --> 08:12.670
<i>the crown prince of this nation 
will wage wars on other countries,</i>

08:12.670 --> 08:17.550
<i>and I'm formulating a plan to stop him... but 
it's not as though I can tell him that.</i>

08:17.550 --> 08:19.270
Listen well, milady,

08:19.270 --> 08:22.940
I trust my intuition a great deal,

08:22.940 --> 08:25.690
but what I regard as even more 
important is results and—

08:25.690 --> 08:28.230
Results and proof of performance, right?

08:30.050 --> 08:34.840
I will think of a business which will 
prove successful here in the capital.

08:34.840 --> 08:38.690
If you deem me worthy of 
your trust because of it,

08:38.690 --> 08:41.660
then may I ask that you reevaluate 
this decision at that time?

08:47.460 --> 08:48.840
I like it!

08:48.840 --> 08:51.610
You're saying that if your idea 
seems likely to turn a profit,

08:51.610 --> 08:53.660
you want me to acknowledge you.

08:53.660 --> 08:55.590
That's exactly the sort of thing I like.

08:55.590 --> 08:57.840
<i>Yes, I know that very well.</i>

08:58.070 --> 09:02.460
You have a week. I'm looking 
forward to this, milady.

09:02.460 --> 09:04.450
Then it's a promise.

09:08.640 --> 09:10.630
Thank you for your time.

09:10.630 --> 09:15.130
And when everyone wakes, please 
have them drink this medicine.

09:16.610 --> 09:18.120
What is it?

09:18.120 --> 09:21.240
I think you'll understand 
quickly once you use it.

09:27.930 --> 09:30.630
It isn't a simple thing to 
sneak out of this place.

09:37.950 --> 09:39.510
You were out late.

09:40.610 --> 09:42.760
Your Highness, why are you here?

09:42.760 --> 09:45.500
I heard that your offer 
of trade was turned down.

09:46.700 --> 09:48.580
It's a strange story.

09:48.580 --> 09:53.610
A simple trader rejecting a request 
from a future crown princess?

09:55.480 --> 09:58.220
I'm the one who said to 
spend your time as you like.

09:58.220 --> 10:02.030
That's why I believe it would be 
unreasonable of me to criticize your actions,

10:02.030 --> 10:04.090
so I awaited your return instead. However...

10:37.360 --> 10:43.690
So, even you look like that 
when faced with a man alone at night.

10:49.800 --> 10:52.880
I... am very sorry.

10:54.500 --> 11:00.070
Sneaking out of the villa alone at night is 
unbecoming of my position as your fiancée.

11:00.070 --> 11:01.620
If your reputation were damaged because—

11:01.620 --> 11:03.310
I don't care about that.

11:06.230 --> 11:08.020
You're not hurt, are you?

11:08.240 --> 11:08.860
What?

11:10.000 --> 11:12.520
No, I'm not.

11:14.730 --> 11:18.690
From now on, whenever you visit 
town, I will go with you.

11:18.690 --> 11:19.260
What?

11:19.700 --> 11:22.530
I told you. You're free to do as you like.

11:22.530 --> 11:25.470
I also told you that I 
would help you in that.

11:25.470 --> 11:29.800
Oh, but... I couldn't possibly ask Your 
Highness to go along with my selfish behavior!

11:29.800 --> 11:32.060
I said that you're free to do as you like.

11:32.060 --> 11:34.580
I didn't say you're free 
to put yourself in danger.

11:36.290 --> 11:37.170
What is it?

11:37.480 --> 11:39.670
You're much too indulgent with me.

11:41.150 --> 11:42.430
Well, as it's you,

11:42.890 --> 11:45.870
if I try to restrict you by saying that 
you're never allowed to visit town again,

11:45.870 --> 11:47.840
you'd just slip out quietly 
again, wouldn't you?

11:48.420 --> 11:50.230
Even if it meant dyeing your hair.

11:50.990 --> 11:55.190
Giving permission with conditions attached 
seems more likely to work as a restraint.

11:55.190 --> 11:58.190
Am I really so easily understood?

11:58.190 --> 11:59.110
Not at all.

11:59.640 --> 12:03.750
You're the type that's so difficult to 
understand that I can't predict you at all.

12:05.600 --> 12:07.440
You're enjoying this, aren't you?

12:07.440 --> 12:09.740
You and the chief both.

12:10.360 --> 12:11.720
The chief?

12:12.400 --> 12:15.960
What has passed between you 
and the Aria Trading Company?

12:18.680 --> 12:19.690
Your Highness?

12:19.690 --> 12:20.590
Yes?

12:21.010 --> 12:23.090
Do you happen to be hungry?

13:00.800 --> 13:03.240
Um, Y-Your Highness?

13:04.390 --> 13:06.730
There's something I must apologize for.

13:06.730 --> 13:07.640
What is it?

13:09.200 --> 13:13.990
I'm terribly sorry, even though 
I'm the one who proposed it...

13:14.580 --> 13:15.710
I, um...

13:16.650 --> 13:19.880
I'm a terrible cook!

13:23.280 --> 13:24.300
I see.

13:25.070 --> 13:27.080
I'm very sorry.

13:27.080 --> 13:31.990
Well, it's unusual to find a noble 
 lady who has experience cooking.

13:33.280 --> 13:39.090
<i>In my past lives, meals were just a time 
when I prioritized putting food in my stomach.</i>

13:39.990 --> 13:43.000
I don't think this soup will 
suit your tastes, Your Highness.

13:46.990 --> 13:48.010
It's good.

13:48.010 --> 13:48.790
What?

13:50.000 --> 13:51.760
This soup will do just fine.

13:53.190 --> 13:56.500
<i>I don't think he can tell 
good flavors from bad.</i>

13:55.640 --> 13:56.500
Hey.

13:56.500 --> 13:58.900
You're thinking something 
disrespectful, aren't you?

13:58.900 --> 14:00.880
No, not at all!

14:02.330 --> 14:04.060
Thank you.

14:04.060 --> 14:06.020
It's your fault that I'm hungry.

14:06.470 --> 14:08.120
Let's hurry up and set out the dishes.

14:08.690 --> 14:09.660
Of course!

14:12.260 --> 14:13.660
Which is why...

14:13.890 --> 14:18.230
I now have to propose a new 
business idea within a week.

14:20.040 --> 14:21.210
I understand.

14:21.210 --> 14:22.560
Which means?

14:22.560 --> 14:24.670
I said I understand.

14:24.670 --> 14:27.300
I comprehend what it is you want to do.

14:28.460 --> 14:33.810
You're not going to ask me what I plan 
to use the Aria Trading Company for?

14:34.070 --> 14:36.890
You kept that a secret from the 
trading company, didn't you?

14:36.890 --> 14:39.060
Then, I can't imagine that you'd tell me.

14:39.060 --> 14:40.860
It's just as you say, but...

14:41.320 --> 14:44.600
Have you figured out this business 
or whatever you're thinking up?

14:44.600 --> 14:46.480
I have several ideas.

14:46.480 --> 14:49.070
It's just that I don't know 
if any of them will work.

14:49.640 --> 14:52.220
What kinds of people live in the capital?

14:52.220 --> 14:54.330
What sorts of things do they love?

14:54.330 --> 14:56.880
There's a mountain of 
things I need to research.

14:56.880 --> 14:59.510
You're saying this will be a difficult fight.

14:59.510 --> 15:00.350
Yes.

15:05.130 --> 15:07.590
You really are enjoying this, aren't you?

15:08.380 --> 15:09.740
You should do as you like.

15:10.280 --> 15:11.920
I have to get back.

15:11.920 --> 15:13.960
Yes, of course. Good night.

15:17.350 --> 15:19.270
Is something wrong?

15:19.650 --> 15:21.620
Have you met my younger brother?

15:21.620 --> 15:24.350
Your Highness's younger brother? No.

15:24.350 --> 15:25.520
That's good.

15:25.750 --> 15:28.820
If he approaches you, don't entertain him.

15:28.820 --> 15:30.280
Is there something I should know?

15:30.280 --> 15:32.180
There's no need for you to know.

15:52.080 --> 15:54.400
<i>This town's population, 
its male to female ratio,</i>

15:54.400 --> 15:57.270
<i>and its age distribution are 
the minimum information I need.</i>

15:57.270 --> 15:59.180
<i>Changes in its economic development...</i>

15:59.180 --> 16:01.310
<i>the state of the surrounding regions...</i>

16:01.310 --> 16:04.940
<i>information on traders and travelers 
entering and leaving, too...</i>

16:07.360 --> 16:10.770
<i>I garden in the morning, check 
teaching materials in the afternoon,</i>

16:10.770 --> 16:13.450
<i>and I have to prepare for the 
wedding ceremony as well.</i>

16:13.450 --> 16:15.750
<i>I won't be getting any 
sleep or rest for a while!</i>

16:17.140 --> 16:18.950
A midnight snack? You, my lord?

16:18.950 --> 16:20.030
What of it?

16:20.030 --> 16:21.000
Nothing.

16:21.000 --> 16:24.000
Lady Rishe must be an excellent cook.

16:24.680 --> 16:27.210
She said she's terrible at cooking...

16:27.610 --> 16:28.660
but it was good.

16:30.840 --> 16:31.560
Hey.

16:31.960 --> 16:36.350
Is adding medicinal herbs 
to soup a standard practice?

16:36.790 --> 16:38.230
To soup?

16:38.230 --> 16:40.600
No, that isn't usually done.

16:42.080 --> 16:42.980
I see.

16:48.670 --> 16:51.860
Were you unable to get much rest last night?

16:51.860 --> 16:54.340
I was doing a little research.

16:54.340 --> 16:56.700
Please don't push yourself too hard.

17:00.570 --> 17:03.330
Lady Rishe! Please stand back!

17:03.330 --> 17:04.780
Let's return to your room.

17:06.890 --> 17:09.680
<i>Black hair is rare on this continent.</i>

17:09.680 --> 17:10.900
Lady Rishe!

17:12.740 --> 17:13.950
Rishe?

17:13.950 --> 17:14.750
Oh no!

17:17.680 --> 17:20.050
You are my older brother's...

17:23.500 --> 17:26.520
Pleased to meet you, my lovely older sister!

17:27.940 --> 17:29.810
Finally, we meet!

17:29.810 --> 17:33.040
I've sent so many letters 
saying I wanted to meet you,

17:33.040 --> 17:35.790
but my brother hasn't sent a single reply.

17:35.790 --> 17:37.070
Isn't that just mean?

17:40.160 --> 17:43.080
There's no need to be so tense.

17:44.140 --> 17:46.070
I'm Theodore.

17:46.070 --> 17:48.060
Theodore Auguste Hein.

17:48.060 --> 17:52.340
I'm second in line to the throne 
and Arnold Hein's younger brother.

17:52.740 --> 17:55.650
<i>I've been told not to spend 
time with him, but...</i>

17:58.650 --> 18:00.610
I'm honored to meet you.

18:00.610 --> 18:03.190
My name is Rishe Irmgard Weitzner.

18:03.920 --> 18:09.000
A twist of fate has allowed me to fill the 
lowest position in the imperial family.

18:09.000 --> 18:11.140
I hope that we will get on well together.

18:11.140 --> 18:13.860
I was wondering, what are you 
doing out here, dear sister?

18:13.860 --> 18:17.360
This garden plot is one that I've created.

18:17.360 --> 18:18.880
You made this?

18:18.880 --> 18:21.300
That's amazing!

18:21.300 --> 18:23.910
It's rare to find a bed so fluffy!

18:24.380 --> 18:27.670
But there is one thing bothering me.

18:27.670 --> 18:28.920
Will you look here for me?

18:28.920 --> 18:30.920
Is something the matter?

18:31.330 --> 18:32.610
See? Right here.

18:33.720 --> 18:35.260
Well...

18:36.610 --> 18:38.090
I want to save you.

18:40.800 --> 18:44.840
You poor thing. Dragged all 
the way to a place like this.

18:44.840 --> 18:48.430
You aren't truly a bride. You're a hostage.

18:50.360 --> 18:51.810
I'm aware.

18:51.810 --> 18:52.860
You are?

18:53.750 --> 18:58.150
Prince Arnold is more than 
satisfactorily considerate toward me.

18:59.650 --> 19:00.830
I see.

19:04.280 --> 19:07.180
I'm glad I was able to meet 
you today! I'll see you again.

19:13.180 --> 19:16.170
<i>Second in line to the throne?</i>

19:16.170 --> 19:20.000
<i>That's not something you say as an 
introduction to your older brother's fiancée.</i>

19:23.520 --> 19:25.680
This may seem apropos of nothing,

19:25.680 --> 19:29.630
but earlier, you didn't 
seem your usual selves.

19:30.240 --> 19:33.810
Do you have orders not to let 
me near his younger brother?

19:34.250 --> 19:37.520
That isn't something we 
would be able to tell you.

19:37.520 --> 19:41.150
Then, do the brothers get along well?

19:42.880 --> 19:44.570
We can't speak to that either.

19:44.960 --> 19:47.120
I'm sorry for asking such strange questions.

19:47.120 --> 19:47.950
Not at all.

19:49.830 --> 19:53.140
<i>I'll have to deal with 
this matter eventually,</i>

19:53.140 --> 19:55.580
<i>but right now, my negotiation 
with the chief comes first.</i>

19:56.340 --> 19:57.910
Don't make me repeat myself.

19:58.320 --> 20:00.880
Our military force will be 
turned to the protection of the people.

20:00.880 --> 20:02.570
The decision has already been made.

20:02.570 --> 20:06.160
Ignoring the regional lords in order to 
tenderheartedly protect the commoners?

20:06.160 --> 20:07.780
What's the meaning of this?

20:07.780 --> 20:12.850
The nobility has their private armies, and 
the nation provides the funds to maintain them.

20:12.850 --> 20:14.030
You can say whatever you like.

20:14.030 --> 20:16.900
Your Highness, please reconsider!

20:17.430 --> 20:21.990
I can't say that your father 
will be pleased by this order.

20:23.850 --> 20:26.410
I will not argue with you. Know your place.

20:33.540 --> 20:35.330
Um...

20:52.080 --> 20:54.610
I'll have separate notices sent to the lords.

20:54.610 --> 20:56.680
Notices?

20:56.680 --> 21:01.190
Our protecting the people just needs to 
end up being in their favor, correct?

21:01.590 --> 21:07.220
If our forces are turned to protecting the 
people and they are able to live in safety,

21:07.220 --> 21:11.080
that will ultimately lead to increased tax 
revenue which should benefit the lords.

21:14.750 --> 21:19.090
If that's the case, then the lords 
will likely accept the change.

21:19.090 --> 21:20.710
This conversation is over.

21:25.900 --> 21:28.280
The indemnities gained through war

21:28.280 --> 21:31.970
are invested locally in revitalization 
and creating employment.

21:31.970 --> 21:35.600
This policy was created by Arnold Hein.

21:36.640 --> 21:40.990
<i>He is forcefully introducing 
policies which benefit the people.</i>

21:41.480 --> 21:45.560
<i>He really is very different from the 
impressions I have of him from my past lives.</i>

21:48.740 --> 21:51.180
Well then, good night.

21:51.180 --> 21:52.490
Good night, my lady.

22:02.590 --> 22:06.840
I will confide a secret to
you. Be at the chapel
tonight at twelve.

22:02.590 --> 22:06.840
Arnold Hein

22:26.080 --> 22:27.650
Good evening,

22:27.650 --> 22:29.130
Prince Theodore.

22:30.580 --> 22:32.030
Good evening,

22:32.420 --> 22:34.100
my lovely older sister.
